# GITIGNORED ON PURPOSE — keep wrangler.toml visible so accidental changes show
# up in `git status`, but make it impossible to commit the locally-injected
# D1 database_id. The committed value must stay a placeholder; see
# scripts/set-d1-id.sh and wrangler.toml.example.
#
# If you need to change anything ELSE in wrangler.toml:
#   git add -p wrangler.toml     # stage everything except the database_id line
